								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=710.msg6366#msg6366"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=710.msg6366#msg6366">Re:Who's Time?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> March 19, 2004, 10:19:46 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Yea, that&#039;s why I call everyone else cool dudes with really big penis&#039;, cause that&#039;s what I&#039;m REALLY like.<br /></div><br />I&#039;m sorry that violates 2 rules of phsyics... <br /><br />Law of Penis Waving: &nbsp;Anyone who says they are large.. or buys the biggest condoms they can find and start a conversation about it with the clerk... is small<br /><br />Law of &quot;Teh Cool&quot;: &nbsp;1 in 6 people think they are cool.. That is 1 billion people.. that cannot be.. In life there are a few winners and a whole lotta losers.. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
